{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "uSREYPLBPa", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Dan Rather (New York)", "segment_description": "NOTE - Local weather bulletin on screen from 5:41:40 to 5:43:30.", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760553, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "QdxV22yzib", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "September 11 / Final Commission Report / United Flight 93 / Victims\u2019 Families", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) The major findings & recommendations of the final report of the panel investigating the September 11 attacks outlined. \n (Washington: Jim Stewart) The 9/11 Commission Report reviewed; details given about the recommendations for a national director of intelligence and a national counterterrorism center, and about what was learned about Al Qaeda leader Osama bin Laden from terrorist detainees; other recommendations & findings, including the role of Saudi Arabia & an Iraq-Al Qaeda-9/11 link, outlined; video shown of hijackers going through security at Dulles National Airport in Washington, DC. [9/11 Commission John LEHMAN&#134;- speaks of a fundamental dysfunction in intelligence gathering & analysis.] [9/11 Commission chairman Thomas KEAN&#134;- says none of the measures adopted before 9/11 disturbed or delayed the Al Qaeda plot.] The Commission\u2019s conclusion that the administrations of Presidents Clinton and Bush are equally to blame noted. \n (Studio: Dan Rather) The views of 9/11 Commission vice-chairman Lee Hamilton on the urgency of enacting the recommendations in the report presented. [HAMILTON \u2013 says all of us expect another terror attack to take place in the US; states we encourage every sense of urgency to move forward.] \n (Washington: Bob Orr) The panel\u2019s finding on the events taking place on United Flight 93 before its crash in Pennsylvania on September 11 reviewed; animation shown; details given of transcripts revealing that hijacker Ziad Jarrah&#134;&#134; chose to crash the plane when faced with a passenger revolt. [Cleveland air traffic manager Rick KETTELL&#134;- relates hearing the pilot yelling at the hijackers who stormed the cockpit.] \n (Studio: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (Washington: Sharyl Attkisson) The continuing work of the families of victims of 9/11 to get the Commission\u2019s recommendations implemented featured. [9/11 widow Monica GABRIELLE&#134;- says this is the end of one chapter.] [Victim\u2019s father Matt SELLITTO&#134;- says we don\u2019t want this to happen again.] [9/11 widows Beverly ECKERT&#134;, Lorie VAN AUKEN&#134;- comment on lobbying Congress.]", "segment_duration": 520, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760554, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "OizedseENm", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "Homeland Security / Ship Search", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) The Coast Guard\u2019s search of a Turkish merchant ship after a crewmember said there might be a bomb on board reported; scenes shown of the ship at Big Stone Beach, Delaware.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63570.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760555, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "VoSbwuyR3p", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "Turkey / Train Derailment", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) The derailment of a passenger train in Turkey reported; scenes shown from near Pamukova.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63600.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760556, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "AhLX7eYqwx", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items; fallen soldier Army Pfc. Cody Orr&#134<!-- spelling on screen --> profiled. (Studio: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63620.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760557, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "b8k0K4Nyr3", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Lamisil; Aleve; Maalox; Procrit; Hidden Valley Ranch; Terminix.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63670.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760558, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "Tf4J7PDIgB", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "Iraq, Afghanistan / Prisoner Abuse Scandal", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) The Army\u2019s report to Congress on the number of cases of prisoner abuse by US soldiers in Iraq & Afghanistan noted.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63820.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760559, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "GiY5knYZuq", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "Inside Story (Military Shortages)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) Clashes between US troops & militants in Baghdad & Ramadi, Iraq, noted. \n (Baghdad: Kimberly Dozier) The US military\u2019s shortage of money, soldiers, equipment & ammunition due to the continuous fighting in Iraq & Afghanistan examined; GAO figures on budget shortfalls cited. [Representative John SPRATT&#134;- comments on the monetary cost of the war.]", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63850.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760560, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760553, "segment_id": "rVFK40kdNc", "segment_broadcast_id": "GDTm0Hoe83", "segment_title": "Los Alamos National Lab / Security Clampdown", "segment_description": "(Studio: Dan Rather) The decision of the director of the Los Alamos National Lab to place 15 workers on leave after classified computer disks disappeared last week reported.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "